### =====================================================
### Index Definition Sample Requests
### Demonstrates analyzers on sub-fields of complex fields, and
### suggesters over complex sub-fields, string collections and
### fields that aren't searchable, with the suggester definitions
### Azure AI Search rejects.
### =====================================================
###
### SETUP ORDER:
### 1. Create the index
### 2. Upload the documents
### 3. Search and suggest (each title gives the expected ids)
### 4. Index definitions Azure rejects
### 5. Cleanup
###
### Prerequisites:
### - The simulator running at https://localhost:7250
### - REST Client extension for VS Code
### - For the [AZURE] requests: an Azure AI Search service with role-based
###   access, the Search Service Contributor and Search Index Data Contributor
###   roles, and AZURE_BASE_URL and ENTRA_TOKEN in .env (see .env.example).
###   To use keys instead, replace "Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}"
###   with an api-key header.
### - Each request is a [SIM]/[AZURE] pair; run the steps in order on each.
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}
@apiVersion = {{$dotenv API_VERSION}}
@adminKey = {{$dotenv ADMIN_KEY}}
@queryKey = {{$dotenv QUERY_KEY}}
@azureBaseUrl = {{$dotenv AZURE_BASE_URL}}
@azureToken = {{$dotenv ENTRA_TOKEN}}

# =====================================================
# 1. CREATE THE INDEX
# =====================================================

### [SIM] Create an index with a language analyzer on each sub-field, and a suggester over a sub-field, a collection and a field that isn't searchable
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-sample",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    {
      "name": "name", "type": "Edm.ComplexType",
      "fields": [
        { "name": "en", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true, "analyzer": "en.lucene" },
        { "name": "fr", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true, "analyzer": "fr.lucene" }
      ]
    },
    { "name": "tags", "type": "Collection(Edm.String)", "searchable": true },
    { "name": "brand", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": false, "filterable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [
    { "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["name/en", "tags", "brand"] }
  ]
}

### [AZURE] Create an index with a language analyzer on each sub-field, and a suggester over a sub-field, a collection and a field that isn't searchable
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-sample",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    {
      "name": "name", "type": "Edm.ComplexType",
      "fields": [
        { "name": "en", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true, "analyzer": "en.lucene" },
        { "name": "fr", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true, "analyzer": "fr.lucene" }
      ]
    },
    { "name": "tags", "type": "Collection(Edm.String)", "searchable": true },
    { "name": "brand", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": false, "filterable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [
    { "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["name/en", "tags", "brand"] }
  ]
}

# =====================================================
# 2. UPLOAD THE DOCUMENTS
# =====================================================

### [SIM] Upload two products
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/index?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "value": [
    { "@search.action": "upload", "id": "1", "name": { "en": "Running shoes", "fr": "Chaussures de course" }, "tags": ["sport", "outdoor"], "brand": "Trail Masters" },
    { "@search.action": "upload", "id": "2", "name": { "en": "Coffee cups", "fr": "Tasses à café" }, "tags": ["kitchen"], "brand": "Cafe Royal" }
  ]
}

### [AZURE] Upload two products
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/index?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "value": [
    { "@search.action": "upload", "id": "1", "name": { "en": "Running shoes", "fr": "Chaussures de course" }, "tags": ["sport", "outdoor"], "brand": "Trail Masters" },
    { "@search.action": "upload", "id": "2", "name": { "en": "Coffee cups", "fr": "Tasses à café" }, "tags": ["kitchen"], "brand": "Cafe Royal" }
  ]
}

# =====================================================
# 3. SEARCH AND SUGGEST
# =====================================================

### [SIM] The English analyzer on name/en stems "runs" and "running" alike → 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "runs",
  "searchFields": "name/en",
  "select": "id, name"
}

### [AZURE] The English analyzer on name/en stems "runs" and "running" alike → 1
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "runs",
  "searchFields": "name/en",
  "select": "id, name"
}

### [SIM] The French analyzer on name/fr stems "tasse" and "tasses" alike → 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "tasse",
  "searchFields": "name/fr",
  "select": "id, name"
}

### [AZURE] The French analyzer on name/fr stems "tasse" and "tasses" alike → 2
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "tasse",
  "searchFields": "name/fr",
  "select": "id, name"
}

### [SIM] Suggest from a complex sub-field → 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/suggest?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "sho",
  "suggesterName": "sg"
}

### [AZURE] Suggest from a complex sub-field → 1
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/suggest?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "sho",
  "suggesterName": "sg"
}

### [SIM] Suggest from a string collection → 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/suggest?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "kitch",
  "suggesterName": "sg"
}

### [AZURE] Suggest from a string collection → 2
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/suggest?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "kitch",
  "suggesterName": "sg"
}

### [SIM] Suggest from a field that isn't searchable, matching any of its words → 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/suggest?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "mast",
  "suggesterName": "sg"
}

### [AZURE] Suggest from a field that isn't searchable, matching any of its words → 1
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/suggest?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "mast",
  "suggesterName": "sg"
}

### [SIM] Searches don't match that field → none
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{queryKey}}

{
  "search": "masters",
  "select": "id"
}

### [AZURE] Searches don't match that field → none
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample/docs/search?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "search": "masters",
  "select": "id"
}

# =====================================================
# 4. INDEX DEFINITIONS AZURE REJECTS (HTTP 400)
# =====================================================

### [SIM] An index can have only one suggester → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-two-suggesters",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "title", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true },
    { "name": "summary", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [
    { "name": "sg1", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["title"] },
    { "name": "sg2", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["summary"] }
  ]
}

### [AZURE] An index can have only one suggester → 400
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-two-suggesters",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "title", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true },
    { "name": "summary", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [
    { "name": "sg1", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["title"] },
    { "name": "sg2", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["summary"] }
  ]
}

### [SIM] A suggester's source fields must be strings → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-numeric-source",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "stock", "type": "Edm.Int32", "filterable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [{ "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["stock"] }]
}

### [AZURE] A suggester's source fields must be strings → 400
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-numeric-source",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "stock", "type": "Edm.Int32", "filterable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [{ "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["stock"] }]
}

### [SIM] A suggester names each source field once → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-duplicate-source",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "title", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [{ "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["title", "title"] }]
}

### [AZURE] A suggester names each source field once → 400
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-duplicate-source",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "title", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true }
  ],
  "suggesters": [{ "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["title", "title"] }]
}

### [SIM] A suggester's source fields must use the default analyzer or a language analyzer → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-keyword-source",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "code", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true, "analyzer": "keyword" }
  ],
  "suggesters": [{ "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["code"] }]
}

### [AZURE] A suggester's source fields must use the default analyzer or a language analyzer → 400
POST {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}

{
  "name": "index-definition-keyword-source",
  "fields": [
    { "name": "id", "type": "Edm.String", "key": true },
    { "name": "code", "type": "Edm.String", "searchable": true, "analyzer": "keyword" }
  ],
  "suggesters": [{ "name": "sg", "searchMode": "analyzingInfixMatching", "sourceFields": ["code"] }]
}

# =====================================================
# 5. CLEANUP
# =====================================================

### [SIM] Delete the index
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample?api-version={{apiVersion}}
api-key: {{adminKey}}

### [AZURE] Delete the index
DELETE {{azureBaseUrl}}/indexes/index-definition-sample?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{azureToken}}
